# Minimal building collision mesh — side faces only, no top/bottom caps
# 4m x 4m footprint at Y=0, 10m height
# 8 vertices, 4 side faces (8 triangles), pivot at Y=0 base-center
# Authored per architecture/asset-standards/3d-model-standards.md
# Constraint: convex hull _col.obj, side-faces only, <= 24 tris, Y=0
o building_col
v -2.0  0.0 -2.0
v  2.0  0.0 -2.0
v  2.0  0.0  2.0
v -2.0  0.0  2.0
v -2.0 10.0 -2.0
v  2.0 10.0 -2.0
v  2.0 10.0  2.0
v -2.0 10.0  2.0
# South face (-Z side)
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
# East face (+X side)
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
# North face (+Z side)
f 3 4 8
f 3 8 7
# West face (-X side)
f 4 1 5
f 4 5 8
